+*   **Ray Equation:** $\mathbf{p}(t) = \mathbf{o} + t\mathbf{d}$ [S2][S4, S8, S9, S10, S11, S12, S18, S19, S20, S21, S22, S29, S31, S34, S36, unofficial][S39].
